Some parts are adapted from herdr-app 0.1.17 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), whose
shipped defaults are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 in this
folder). Each was changed to fit this mod; the herdr originals are named below.

game/agents.js
    TITLE_MARK is the title-cleaning regular expression of defaults/mods/agents/main.js
    (clean()), unchanged. judgeTitle() follows that file's title() "telling" test (the path test
    and its regular expression; the address, program name and key comparisons). PROCESS_NAMES
    lists the "shells" and "interpreters" of defaults/programs.json.

ui/party.js
    Takes the place of the agents list, defaults/mods/agents/main.js: toggleSidebar() (the rail,
    the shared sidebar.width / sidebar.collapsed keys, the 44 / 76 px rail widths) and the status
    ranks (RANK) follow it.

host.js
    snapshot() reads a pane-less sub-agent's status as defaults/mods/agents/main.js kidStatus()
    does (error counts as blocked, done as idle).

ui/nameplate.js
    Takes the place of the pane header, defaults/mods/pane/main.js: paneFrame() (unchanged),
    folder(), the program icon, the plain header's name rule, the frame's border side and the
    hover buttons that split, zoom and close the pane follow it. Its text spinner is the one
    defaults/mods/peek/main.js draws. The button icons (art/ui) are this project's own drawings.

game/view/chrome.js
    AGENT_ICONS records which of the agent programs in defaults/programs.json draw a tinted icon.

layouts/Down-the-Stack.json
    Derived from defaults/layouts/main.json: the same tree with the agents list replaced by the
    party, the pane header by the nameplate, and the stage and HUD blocks, colours and preview
    added.

Everything else here (the game, its art and its text) is this project's own work.
